Q3 - The most reliable SQL query to get the second-highest distinct salary is:
SELECT MAX(salary) FROM employees WHERE salary < (SELECT MAX(salary) FROM employees);

=> second-highest distinct salary using DENSE_RANK()
SELECT name, salary
FROM (
    SELECT name, salary,
           DENSE_RANK() OVER (ORDER BY salary DESC) AS rnk
    FROM employees
) t
WHERE rnk = 2;


